{
  "id": "relative_vs__absolute_voltage",
  "title": "Relative vs. Absolute Voltage",
  "description": "Calculate relative and absolute voltage in electric circuits. Determine voltage between two points and voltage relative to earth (ground) reference.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Relative vs. Absolute Voltage\n\n**Absolute Voltage (UA)**: Voltage at point A quoted with reference to the earth point (ground reference).\n\n**Relative Voltage (UAB)**: Voltage at point A quoted with reference to point B.\n\n### Formulas Used:\n- Total Resistance: R = R₁ + R₂ + R₃ + ...\n- Current: I = U / R\n- Relative Voltage: UAB = R × I\n- Absolute Voltage at B: UB = UA - UAB"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Input Parameters",
        "Value"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "totalVoltage",
          "label": "Total Voltage (U)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "V",
          "defaultValue": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "resistor1",
          "label": "Resistor 1 (R₁)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "defaultValue": 33
        },
        {
          "id": "resistor2",
          "label": "Resistor 2 (R₂)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "defaultValue": 47
        },
        {
          "id": "resistor3",
          "label": "Resistor 3 (R₃)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "defaultValue": 33
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "totalResistance",
          "label": "Total Resistance (R)",
          "formula": "inputs.resistor1 + inputs.resistor2 + inputs.resistor3",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "current",
          "label": "Circuit Current (I)",
          "formula": "inputs.totalVoltage / (inputs.resistor1 + inputs.resistor2 + inputs.resistor3)",
          "unit": "A",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "relativeVoltageAB",
          "label": "Relative Voltage UAB (across R₁)",
          "formula": "inputs.resistor1 * (inputs.totalVoltage / (inputs.resistor1 + inputs.resistor2 + inputs.resistor3))",
          "unit": "V",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "absoluteVoltageA",
          "label": "Absolute Voltage at Point A (UA)",
          "formula": "inputs.totalVoltage",
          "unit": "V",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "absoluteVoltageB",
          "label": "Absolute Voltage at Point B (UB)",
          "formula": "inputs.totalVoltage - (inputs.resistor1 * (inputs.totalVoltage / (inputs.resistor1 + inputs.resistor2 + inputs.resistor3)))",
          "unit": "V",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}